        """Live Events (Server-Sent Events) — A `text/event-stream` of your account's events — `activation.code_received`, `activation.sms_received`, `activation.expired` (refunded), `activation.canceled`, `activation.finished`, `rental.sms_received`, `rental.expired`, `topup.completed`, `reminder.back_in_stock`. Each connection lasts ~55 s; reconnect with `Last-Event-ID` (EventSource does this for you) and nothing is missed — the last 200 events are kept for 7 days. `?once=1` returns pending events as JSON instead, for clients that would rather poll."""
        return await self._t.request("GET", f"/events", query=compact({"since": since}), fixed_query={"once":"1"}, options=request_options)


